{
  "name": "Enrich a Google Sheet of domains with their tech stack (Apify Tech Stack Detector)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "7e670228-2700-4af0-a049-a995e73347df",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 440,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Enrich a sheet of domains with their tech stack\nReads a Google Sheet with a `domain` column, detects each site's technologies with the **Tech Stack Detector** Actor on Apify and writes them back (CMS, e-commerce, analytics, advertising, all technologies).\n\n**Setup (5 min)**\n1. Sheet columns: domain, cms, ecommerce, analytics, advertising, technologies.\n2. Pick the sheet in **Read domains** and **Update sheet**.\n3. In **Detect tech stack**, create an *HTTP Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n\nCost: $1.50 per 1,000 sites (failed sites free). https://apify.com/uianalize/tech-stack-detector"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "08a47f92-8128-439d-8d77-dde3b00c865f",
      "name": "Run manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "08ee98aa-8f7d-4244-baff-9a00e913c62e",
      "name": "Read domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        200,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "417def30-fc2b-430a-a777-cc98c28d9085",
      "name": "Collect domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fieldsToAggregate": {
          "fieldToAggregate": [
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "domain"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f389ff7-e6f3-4f49-aa1d-abe2ab0651cc",
      "name": "Detect tech stack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        600,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/uianalize~tech-stack-detector/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "maxTotalChargeUsd",
              "value": "2"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ urls: $json.domain, includeFailed: true }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Apify API token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "30281d30-2b4e-4a1d-97b6-c905aa1dad05",
      "name": "Format columns",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        800,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "81ef1b98-930b-403e-bc82-3a0b60eb9b85",
              "name": "domain",
              "value": "={{ $json.input }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "59e03bc3-9163-4f54-8fea-0637123226c5",
              "name": "cms",
              "value": "={{ ($json.categories?.CMS || []).join(', ') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "3367010e-c485-4f0a-8a8f-31e9447b86f4",
              "name": "ecommerce",
              "value": "={{ ($json.categories?.['E-commerce'] || []).join(', ') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "98cfe281-e685-4098-8d3b-ee74346726fa",
              "name": "analytics",
              "value": "={{ ($json.categories?.Analytics || []).join(', ') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4ec94ad4-3cf8-42a7-abc4-298343eba5d5",
              "name": "advertising",
              "value": "={{ ($json.categories?.Advertising || []).join(', ') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b002cd5-cb3b-4e5b-81e8-d06622028a71",
              "name": "technologies",
              "value": "={{ ($json.technologies || []).map(t => t.name).join(', ') || $json.error }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5654caf1-a0b9-40a3-a2db-bf0cf331bb24",
      "name": "Update sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1000,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [
            "domain"
          ],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
